+  //                        the address they hand to the executable-range query
+  //                        from it, and the guest registers its ranges at
+  //                        canonical addresses.
+  //   AdjustedInstStream - the HOST pointer whose bytes are actually read.
+  //
+  // Collapsing them made the range query run in host space, where no guest
